{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "target-allocation-branch-dept",
    "name": "Target Allocation API (Branch -> Department)",
    "description": "Full flow: import branch-year (Excel) -> phân bổ phòng (năm) -> phân bổ quý -> confirm -> tree -> re-allocate. Contract: docs/api/TARGET_ALLOCATION_CONTRACT.md.\n\nChạy tuần tự (Collection Runner) trên DB vừa seed (seed_dev_data.sql). Dùng KPI KH_MOI vì HDV/DU_NO đã có target quý cho phòng KD/GD trong seed (sẽ trả 409). Điền managerPassword và chọn file Excel cho request import.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login branch manager (NV001)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{managerPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Has accessToken', () => pm.expect(j.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Import branch-year (Excel)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Import without file -> 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": []
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/import?branchId={{branchId}}&year={{year}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "import"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "branchId",
                  "value": "{{branchId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "year",
                  "value": "{{year}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Import year targets -> 201",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/import?branchId={{branchId}}&year={{year}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "import"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "branchId",
                  "value": "{{branchId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "year",
                  "value": "{{year}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Chọn file .xlsx ở tab Body: sheet 1, dòng 1 là header, cột A = tên KPI \"Khách hàng mới\", cột B = 600.\nSeed đã có KH_MOI năm 2026 ACTIVE 480 nên import tạo version mới ACTIVE (\"Re-import\"); DB trống thì tạo DRAFT."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "function findNode(nodes, pred) {",
                  "  for (const n of nodes || []) { if (pred(n)) return n; const c = findNode(n.children, pred); if (c) return c; }",
                  "  return null;",
                  "}",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const n = findNode(j.data.targets, x => x.kpiDefinitionId === pm.collectionVariables.get('kpiId') && x.departmentId === pm.collectionVariables.get('branchId') && x.periodType === 'YEAR' && x.status !== 'SUPERSEDED');",
                  "pm.test('Branch-year node found', () => pm.expect(n).to.exist);",
                  "pm.test('Branch-year = 600', () => pm.expect(Number(n.targetValue)).to.eql(600));",
                  "if (n) pm.collectionVariables.set('branchYearId', n.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Branch -> Departments (year)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Departments sum below branch -> 422",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"departmentId\": \"{{deptKd}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 100\n    },\n    {\n      \"departmentId\": \"{{deptGd}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 100\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changeReason\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/{{branchYearId}}/departments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "{{branchYearId}}", "departments"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('Error code TARGET_DEPARTMENT_SUM_BELOW', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('TARGET_DEPARTMENT_SUM_BELOW'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Team (not direct child of branch) -> 422",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"departmentId\": \"{{teamKd1}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 600\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changeReason\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/{{branchYearId}}/departments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "{{branchYearId}}", "departments"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('Error code TARGET_DEPARTMENT_NOT_IN_BRANCH', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('TARGET_DEPARTMENT_NOT_IN_BRANCH'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Allocate departments (KD 400 + GD 200 = 600) -> 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"departmentId\": \"{{deptKd}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 400\n    },\n    {\n      \"departmentId\": \"{{deptGd}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 200\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changeReason\": \"Phân bổ năm cho phòng\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/{{branchYearId}}/departments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "{{branchYearId}}", "departments"]
            },
            "description": "Gửi đủ mọi phòng mỗi lần (replace full set). Tổng phải bằng đúng branch-year thì bước confirm mới qua."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "function findNode(nodes, pred) {",
                  "  for (const n of nodes || []) { if (pred(n)) return n; const c = findNode(n.children, pred); if (c) return c; }",
                  "  return null;",
                  "}",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "const kpi = pm.collectionVariables.get('kpiId');",
                  "['deptKd', 'deptGd'].forEach(k => {",
                  "  const n = findNode(data, x => x.kpiDefinitionId === kpi && x.departmentId === pm.collectionVariables.get(k) && x.periodType === 'YEAR' && x.status !== 'SUPERSEDED');",
                  "  pm.test(k + ' year node exists', () => pm.expect(n).to.exist);",
                  "  if (n) pm.collectionVariables.set(k + 'YearId', n.id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Department -> Quarters",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Confirm KD before quarters -> 409",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/{{deptKdYearId}}/confirm",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "{{deptKdYearId}}", "confirm"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
                  "pm.test('Error code TARGET_INVALID_STATE', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('TARGET_INVALID_STATE'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "KD quarters sum below year -> 422",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ1}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ2}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ3}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ4}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changeReason\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/{{deptKdYearId}}/quarters",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "{{deptKdYearId}}", "quarters"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('Error code TARGET_QUARTER_SUM_BELOW', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('TARGET_QUARTER_SUM_BELOW'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "KD quarters (100 x 4 = 400) -> 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ1}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 100\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ2}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 100\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ3}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 100\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ4}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 100\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changeReason\": \"Phân bổ quý KD\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/target-assignments/{{deptKdYearId}}/quarters",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["target-assignments", "{{deptKdYearId}}", "quarters"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GD quarters (50 x 4 = 200) -> 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ1}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ2}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ3}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"quarterPeriodId\": \"{{periodQ4}}\",\n      \"kpiDefinitionId\": \"{{kpiId}}\",\n      \"targetValue\": 50\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changeReason\": \"Phân bổ quý GD\"\n}",
              "options": {
